<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25657" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δια-πτύσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διά-ττω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>open and spread out, unfold, disclose</i>:
			metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπτυχθέντες ὤφθησαν κενοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					709
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				985
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				858e
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύμβολα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>Protr.</u>
					21
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγῳ δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Moschio
				</span></i>
			 Trag.<i><span class="en">
				6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>split open,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κράνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					17.20
				</span></i>
			; <i>open up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἐπιγάστριον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					2.520
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>fold one with another, intertwine,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				720b17
			</span></i>.</div>
